    "explanation": "The bounded episode closes with pathology/CT/T-SPOT already reviewed by respiratory clinic, a one-month follow-up plan with specific tests, family communication wording, and urgent-care triggers. The residual etiology/monitoring remains appropriately assigned to respiratory follow-up rather than falsely closed. The closure is safe overall, though the earlier medication duplication counseling gap remains an in-chain minor error.",
