          "quote": "CT正式报告、所有血液检查结果"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor gave concrete steps for scattered records, including where to retrieve reports and which specific documents to bring or preserve, making follow-up feasible without broad family sharing.",
